<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>태국어 LINE 스티커 2,000개 조사 갤러리</title><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f3f4f6;color:#111;font-family:"Segoe UI","Malgun Gothic",sans-serif}header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;padding:12px 16px}h1{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 5px}.note{font-size:12px;color:#666;line-height:1.45}.bar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px}input,select,button{font:inherit;padding:7px 9px;border:1px solid #c9cdd2;border-radius:6px;background:#fff}input{min-width:230px}button{cursor:pointer}button.on{background:#06c755;color:#fff;border-color:#06c755}.pages{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin-top:9px}.pages button{font-size:11px;padding:4px 7px;min-width:67px}.count{font-size:13px;color:#555;margin:2px 0 11px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(215px,1fr));gap:11px}.card{display:block;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 3px #0002;position:relative}.pic{height:190px;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.pic img{width:180px;height:180px;object-fit:contain}.num{position:absolute;top:7px;left:7px;background:#06c755;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:12px}.body{padding:9px 10px 11px}.phrase{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;min-height:22px}.meaning{font-size:12px;color:#444;line-height:1.35;min-height:17px;margin-top:3px}.title{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;margin-top:7px;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}.meta{font-size:11px;color:#666;margin-top:4px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}.tag{display:inline-block;background:#eef2ff;color:#334;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;margin-right:4px}.wrap{padding:14px 16px 40px}
</style></head><body><header><h1>태국어 LINE 스티커 2,000개 조사</h1><div class="note">Gemini 작업의 <b>INCLUDE_THAI</b> 보고 자료입니다. 독립 검증 완료 자료가 아니며, 누적 판매 순위가 아닙니다. 카드 클릭 시 LINE 상품 페이지가 열립니다.</div><div class="bar"><input id="q" placeholder="태국어·한국어·상품명·ID 검색"><select id="cat"><option value="">카테고리 전체</option><option>ACKNOWLEDGMENT</option><option>AFFECTION</option><option>AFFIRMATION</option><option>AGREEMENT</option><option>APOLOGY</option><option>BLESSING</option><option>CARE</option><option>caring</option><option>chat</option><option>COMFORT</option><option>CULTURE_RELIGION</option><option>daily</option><option>emotion</option><option>encouragement</option><option>ENCOURAGEMENT</option><option>EXCLAMATION</option><option>EXHAUSTION</option><option>FAREWELL</option><option>GRATITUDE</option><option>greeting</option><option>GREETING</option><option>polite</option><option>POLITENESS</option><option>PRAISE</option><option>QUESTION</option><option>REFUSAL</option><option>REQUEST</option><option>STATUS</option><option>work</option><option>가족</option><option>감사</option><option>감사 화답</option><option>감상/식사</option><option>감정</option><option>감정/그리움</option><option>감정/기쁨</option><option>감정/난처</option><option>감정/놀람</option><option>감정/두통</option><option>감정/반응</option><option>감정/방전</option><option>감정/배려</option><option>감정/수줍음</option><option>감정/안도</option><option>감정/애정</option><option>감정/웃음</option><option>감정/위로</option><option>감정/의문</option><option>감정/지침</option><option>감정/토라짐</option><option>감정표현</option><option>감정/피로</option><option>감정/혼란</option><option>감정/화해</option><option>감탄</option><option>감탄/칭찬</option><option>거부</option><option>거절</option><option>거절/짜증</option><option>거절/투정</option><option>거절/회피</option><option>건강/안부</option><option>게임/성공</option><option>게임/승리</option><option>격려</option><option>격려/다짐</option><option>격려/응원</option><option>경고</option><option>경고/거절</option><option>경고/원칙</option><option>경고/장난</option><option>계획/업무</option><option>고민</option><option>고민/요청</option><op